riptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"That's how it works, discardable textures can switch between ignoring or loading depending on the frame (hence why I named the other behavior DEFAULT).\r\n\r\nIgnore on these flags should be reserved to be used only in cases where it's impossible for the graph to figure that out, like draw lists that don't clear but cover the entire texture with a triangle.\r\n\r\nThe example of the shadow map atlas, which isn't a discardable texture comes to mind.","created_at":"2024-11-19T14:43:20Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T14:43:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98670#discussion_r1848495088","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98670","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848495088"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98670#discussion_r1848495088"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98670"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848495088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":241,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1847131265,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":35,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1848502300","pull_request_review_id":2445704436,"id":1848502300,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5uLegc","diff_hunk":"@@ -1084,7 +1084,7 @@ void RenderForwardMobile::_render_scene(RenderD